# Build & Test Rules

## After Every Code Change
Run this build check before saying you're done:
```bash
PROJ=/Users/brianbean/Desktop/huehome-pro-v0.3.0
xcodebuild -project "$PROJ/ChromaGlow.xcodeproj" -scheme ChromaGlow -destination 'generic/platform=iOS' build 2>&1 | grep -E 'error:|BUILD SUCCEEDED|BUILD FAILED'
```

## After Every Successful Build
Commit with a descriptive message:
```bash
cd /Users/brianbean/Desktop/huehome-pro-v0.3.0
git add -A && git commit -m "descriptive message here"
```

## Common Build Errors
- "Cannot find type 'X'" → File not added to pbxproj. See xcode-project.mdc.
- "Argument passed to call that takes no arguments" → Check method signatures in existing code, don't guess.
- "Type 'StudioStrategy' does not conform to 'Equatable'" → Already fixed. It's Equatable now.
